0 FILE final-squeeze.ldr
0 Final Squeeze — a loaded knee press
0 Name: final-squeeze.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/final-squeeze.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub; motor A drives only the first of two equal 80 LDU links.
0 // Passive connecting link and retained twin-guide platen compress one intact 9L shock.
0 // Saved 40 degrees, finite press 15 degrees; no dead-center crossing or self-locking claim.
0 // The 2909/2910 entries are two moving CAD components of one purchased shock assembly.
0 // Factory coil is included in that shock; native elasticity is not hardware calibration.
